%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 用户 as U
    participant 微信小程序 as MP
    participant AppOrderController as AC
    participant IClOrderService as OS
    participant IClGoodsService as GS
    participant MySQL as DB

    U->>MP: 提交订单
    MP->>AC: POST /api/app/order/create
    AC->>AC: 按 type 路由 single/multi
    AC->>GS: 校验上架与库存
    GS->>DB: 读 cl_goods
    DB-->>GS: 商品行
    GS-->>AC: 校验结果
    AC->>OS: 生成单号、汇总金额、写库
    OS->>DB: 事务 INSERT cl_order, cl_order_item
    opt 定制 orderType=1
        OS->>DB: INSERT cl_custom_order 排队信息
    end
    DB-->>OS: commit ok
    OS-->>AC: orderId
    AC-->>MP: AjaxResult
    MP-->>U: 订单详情

    U->>MP: 模拟支付
    MP->>AC: POST /api/app/order/mockPay
    AC->>OS: 状态 0 转 1
    OS->>DB: UPDATE cl_order
    AC-->>MP: 成功
